window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'm naturally gifted on the field and between the sheets. With flashy cars and enough media attention to put the royal family to shame, I'm the definition of most eligible bachelor. </p> <p>Every man wants to be me, and every woman wants to tame me. Until Camila. </p> <p>The moment I lay eyes on her, I know I have to have her. </p> <p>She wants to keep me at arm's length. </p> <p>I want her naked in my bed. </p> <p>She thinks our worlds are too different. </p> <p>All I want her to think about is screaming my name. </p> <p>She says I'm bad news. </p> <p>I have three weeks to prove her wrong. </p>"; 
